WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:19.960
The fifth day is over, we have already covered the first chapter of the Sutta, all its different

00:19.960 --> 00:37.720
sections. This section of the chapter of Kayaanupasana, examining the body, observing the body. Now we

00:37.720 --> 00:56.840
come to the next, Vedananupasana. Kayaanupasana is not complete without Vedananupasana because

00:56.840 --> 00:58.600
the Sutta does not want this.

